@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Chat History

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "ChatHistoryView" as HistoryView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Customer -> HistoryView : 1 Open chat widget
activate HistoryView
HistoryView -> HistoryView : 2 Display chat history

HistoryView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request chat history
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch message records
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve chat history
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return message data
ClerkAuth -> HistoryView : 7 Return message info
HistoryView -> Customer : 8 Display chat history

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate HistoryView

@enduml
